      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "父瑗字道言，仕州府為日南、九德、交阯太守。",
      "reading": "父瑗字道言，歷日南、九德、交阯三郡太守。",
      "note": "父瑗字道言，歷日南、九德、交阯三郡太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "初，九真太守李遜父子勇壯有權力，威制交土，聞刺史滕遯之當至，分遣二子斷遏水陸津要，瑗收眾斬遜，州境獲寧。",
      "reading": "九真太守李遜遣二子閉津，瑗斬遜後州境得寧。",
      "note": "九真太守李遜遣二子閉津，瑗斬遜後州境得寧。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "除龍驤將軍。",
      "reading": "瑗除龍驤將軍。",
      "note": "瑗除龍驤將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 79,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-79",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "遯之在州十餘年，與林邑累相攻伐。",
      "reading": "滕遯之在州十餘年，數與林邑交兵。",
      "note": "滕遯之在州十餘年，數與林邑交兵。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 79,
      "end_codepoint": 95,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-95",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "遯之將北還，林邑王范胡達攻破日南、九德、九真三郡，遂圍州城。",
      "reading": "遯之北還，范胡達攻三郡而圍州城。",
      "note": "遯之北還，范胡達攻三郡而圍州城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 95,
      "end_codepoint": 125,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-125",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "時遯之去已遠，瑗與第三子玄之悉力固守，多設權策，累戰，大破之。",
      "reading": "瑗與第三子玄之守城。",
      "note": "瑗與第三子玄之守城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 125,
      "end_codepoint": 156,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-156",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "追討於九真、日南，連捷，故胡達走還林邑。",
      "reading": "胡達退還林邑。",
      "note": "胡達退還林邑。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 156,
      "end_codepoint": 176,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-176",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "乃以瑗為龍驤將軍、交州刺史。",
      "reading": "瑗任龍驤將軍、交州刺史。",
      "note": "瑗任龍驤將軍、交州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 176,
      "end_codepoint": 190,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-190",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "義旗進號冠軍將軍。",
      "reading": "宋武帝建義旗後進冠軍將軍。",
      "note": "宋武帝建義旗後進冠軍將軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 190,
      "end_codepoint": 199,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-duyuan-jiaozhou:received_sentence1-199",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "b7k_v7g_vfe_*A",
      "source_quote": "盧循竊據廣州，遣使通好，瑗斬之。",
      "reading": "盧循遣使通好，瑗斬的是該使者。",
      "note": "盧循遣使通好，瑗斬的是該使者。",
